{"type": "excalidraw", "version": 2, "source": "claude", "elements": [{"type": "text", "id": "m1", "x": 0, "y": -150, "width": 1123.2, "height": 45.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 339564, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 993909, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "TEORIA DE LA INFORMACION - MAPA CONCEPTUAL PARCIAL 1", "fontSize": 36, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 36, "containerId": null, "originalText": "TEORIA DE LA INFORMACION - MAPA CONCEPTUAL PARCIAL 1", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "text", "id": "m2", "x": 0, "y": -95, "width": 1536.0, "height": 20.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 158177, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 414003, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Leelo de arriba hacia abajo: cada franja es una parte del parcial; dentro de cada una, de izquierda a derecha y siguiendo las flechas = orden del procedimiento.", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 16, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Leelo de arriba hacia abajo: cada franja es una parte del parcial; dentro de cada una, de izquierda a derecha y siguiendo las flechas = orden del procedimiento.", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "text", "id": "m3", "x": 0, "y": -68, "width": 1287.0, "height": 18.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#868e96", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 682555, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 50632, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Colores: azul=concepto/teoria | verde=procedimiento | naranja=formula clave | rojo=TRAMPA que bajo nota | amarillo=dato/resultado de referencia", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 15, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Colores: azul=concepto/teoria | verde=procedimiento | naranja=formula clave | rojo=TRAMPA que bajo nota | amarillo=dato/resultado de referencia", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "m4", "x": 0, "y": 0, "width": 1780, "height": 78, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#495057", "backgroundColor": "#495057", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 75955, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 861169, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"type": "text", "id": "m5", "x": 20, "y": 8, "width": 624.0, "height": 32.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#ffffff", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 561914, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 98703, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "0  QUE ENTRA EN EL PARCIAL (mapa rapido)", "fontSize": 26, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 26, "containerId": null, "originalText": "0  QUE ENTRA EN EL PARCIAL (mapa rapido)", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "text", "id": "m6", "x": 20, "y": 46, "width": 1341.0, "height": 18.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#ffffff", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 383453, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 611098, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Siempre 3 bloques con la misma secuencia dos veces: A = fuente independiente | B = fuente de Markov | C = canal.  + extras de discretizacion/teoricas", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 15, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Siempre 3 bloques con la misma secuencia dos veces: A = fuente independiente | B = fuente de Markov | C = canal.  + extras de discretizacion/teoricas", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "m7", "x": 0, "y": 108, "width": 560, "height": 127.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "#e7f5ff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 60817, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 953894, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"type": "text", "id": "m8", "x": 14, "y": 118, "width": 334.8, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 532085, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 225128, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "BLOQUE A - Fuente INDEPENDIENTE", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 18, "containerId": null, "originalText": "BLOQUE A - Fuente INDEPENDIENTE", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "text", "id": "m9", "x": 14, "y": 148, "width": 450.0, "height": 75.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 39318, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 90123, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Memoria nula: usa frecuencias globales p_i = f_i/n\nPide: H, redundancia, algoritmo del tema, comparar\n  con codigo de igual longitud\nNO se arma matriz de transicion", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 15, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Memoria nula: usa frecuencias globales p_i = f_i/n\nPide: H, redundancia, algoritmo del tema, comparar\n  con codigo de igual longitud\nNO se arma matriz de transicion", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "m10", "x": 610, "y": 108, "width": 560, "height": 127.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "backgroundColor": "#f3f0ff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 454711, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 438486, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"type": "text", "id": "m11", "x": 624, "y": 118, "width": 399.59999999999997, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 73249, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 252354, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "BLOQUE B - Fuente de MARKOV (orden 1)", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 18, "containerId": null, "originalText": "BLOQUE B - Fuente de MARKOV (orden 1)", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "text", "id": "m12", "x": 624, "y": 148, "width": 513.0, "height": 75.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 95120, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 577815, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Cada simbolo depende del anterior: usa filas de la matriz\nPide: matriz, H(S_M), ergodico?, estacionaria pi,\n  p(cadena), a veces codificar por estado\n'considerando la fuente como independiente' = frecuencias", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 15, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Cada simbolo depende del anterior: usa filas de la matriz\nPide: matriz, H(S_M), ergodico?, estacionaria pi,\n  p(cadena), a veces codificar por estado\n'considerando la fuente como independiente' = frecuencias", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "m13", "x": 1220, "y": 108, "width": 560, "height": 127.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#0c8599", "backgroundColor": "#e3fafc", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 445141, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 61982, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"type": "text", "id": "m14", "x": 1234, "y": 118, "width": 259.2, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#0c8599", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 867018, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 592922, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "BLOQUE C - CANAL + otros", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 18, "containerId": null, "originalText": "BLOQUE C - CANAL + otros", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "text", "id": "m15", "x": 1234, "y": 148, "width": 486.0, "height": 75.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 129816, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 993474, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Canal (BSC / asimetrico / ternario): I(A;B), capacidad\nDiscretizacion PCM/DPCM, codificacion predictiva (K),\n  cifrado, BWT inversa, Huffman dinamico (decodificar)\n+ 2-3 preguntas teoricas (lista cerrada, franja 7)", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 15, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Canal (BSC / asimetrico / ternario): I(A;B), capacidad\nDiscretizacion PCM/DPCM, codificacion predictiva (K),\n  cifrado, BWT inversa, Huffman dinamico (decodificar)\n+ 2-3 preguntas teoricas (lista cerrada, franja 7)", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "m16", "x": 0, "y": 259.0, "width": 560, "height": 127.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#f08c00", "backgroundColor": "#fff9db", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 234084, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 661260, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"type": "text", "id": "m17", "x": 14, "y": 269.0, "width": 367.2, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#f08c00", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 657912, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 611317, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Algoritmo segun el TEMA (bloque A)", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 18, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Algoritmo segun el TEMA (bloque A)", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "text", "id": "m18", "x": 14, "y": 299.0, "width": 513.0, "height": 75.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 993745, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 64868, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Tema 1: Shannon | Tema 2: Huffman dinamico + Sibling\nTema 3: Aritmetica con 3 decimales | Tema 4: LZ ventana 8\nRecuperatorio: Shannon y Fano 'como independiente',\n  BSC p=1/8, decodificar Huffman dinamico", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 15, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Tema 1: Shannon | Tema 2: Huffman dinamico + Sibling\nTema 3: Aritmetica con 3 decimales | Tema 4: LZ ventana 8\nRecuperatorio: Shannon y Fano 'como independiente',\n  BSC p=1/8, decodificar Huffman dinamico", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "m19", "x": 610, "y": 259.0, "width": 560, "height": 108.25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e8590c", "backgroundColor": "#fff4e6", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 605137, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 613985, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"type": "text", "id": "m20", "x": 624, "y": 269.0, "width": 345.59999999999997, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e8590c", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 415950, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 51999, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Cuenta y entropia: no se mezclan", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 18, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Cuenta y entropia: no se mezclan", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "text", "id": "m21", "x": 624, "y": 299.0, "width": 495.0, "height": 56.25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 231822, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 48846, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "H(S)   = Σ p_i log2(1/p_i)       (indep., p_i globales)\nH(S_M) = Σ pi_i · H(fila i)      (Markov, ponderada)\nH(S_M) <= H(S).  L_M se compara con H(S_M), no con H(S)", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 15, "containerId": null, "originalText": "H(S)   = Σ p_i log2(1/p_i)       (indep., p_i globales)\nH(S_M) = Σ pi_i · H(fila i)      (Markov, ponderada)\nH(S_M) <= H(S).  L_M se compara con H(S_M), no con H(S)", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "m22", "x": 1220, "y": 259.0, "width": 560, "height": 127.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "backgroundColor": "#fff5f5", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 583706, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 900170, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"type": "text", "id": "m23", "x": 1234, "y": 269.0, "width": 280.8, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 139644, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 303678, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Regla de oro del enunciado", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 18, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Regla de oro del enunciado", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "text", "id": "m24", "x": 1234, "y": 299.0, "width": 531.0, "height": 75.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 439500, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 151263, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "LEER LITERAL el verbo: 'capacidad' vs 'info mutua',\n'mejor' vs 'peor' canal, Fano vs Huffman, indep. vs Markov.\nResponder TODOS los incisos y JUSTIFICAR las teoricas.\nDuda -> resolver las dos versiones y rotular cada una.", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 15, "containerId": null, "originalText": "LEER LITERAL el verbo: 'capacidad' vs 'info mutua',\n'mejor' vs 'peor' canal, Fano vs Huffman, indep. vs Markov.\nResponder TODOS los incisos y JUSTIFICAR las teoricas.\nDuda -> resolver las dos versiones y rotular cada una.", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "m25", "x": 0, "y": 450.0, "width": 1780, "height": 78, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "#1971c2", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 566951, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 123515, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"type": "text", "id": "m26", "x": 20, "y": 458.0, "width": 780.0, "height": 32.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#ffffff", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 598647, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 323467, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "1  FUNDAMENTOS: INFORMACION, ENTROPIA, REDUNDANCIA", "fontSize": 26, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 26, "containerId": null, "originalText": "1  FUNDAMENTOS: INFORMACION, ENTROPIA, REDUNDANCIA", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "text", "id": "m27", "x": 20, "y": 496.0, "width": 702.0, "height": 18.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#ffffff", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 587473, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 855771, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Punto de partida de TODO ejercicio: calcular H y compararla con el codigo fijo", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 15, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Punto de partida de TODO ejercicio: calcular H y compararla con el codigo fijo", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "m28", "x": 0, "y": 558.0, "width": 560, "height": 183.25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "#e7f5ff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 715132, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 189506, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"type": "text", "id": "m29", "x": 14, "y": 568.0, "width": 248.39999999999998, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 108062, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 609852, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Cantidad de informacion", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 18, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Cantidad de informacion", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "text", "id": "m30", "x": 14, "y": 598.0, "width": 504.0, "height": 131.25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 598952, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 669950, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "I_i = log2(1/p_i) = -log2 p_i        [bits]\np = 1  ->  I = 0 (no hay incertidumbre)\n\n5 propiedades (teorica fija):\n 1. I >= 0   2. inversa a p   3. crece con n° de sucesos\n 4. aditiva (sucesos independientes)\n 5. H es maxima con equiprobabilidad", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 15, "containerId": null, "originalText": "I_i = log2(1/p_i) = -log2 p_i        [bits]\np = 1  ->  I = 0 (no hay incertidumbre)\n\n5 propiedades (teorica fija):\n 1. I >= 0   2. inversa a p   3. crece con n° de sucesos\n 4. aditiva (sucesos independientes)\n 5. H es maxima con equiprobabilidad", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "m31", "x": 280.0, "y": 741.25, "width": 0.0, "height": 30.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#868e96", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 196998, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 390488, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "points": [[0, 0], [0.0, 30.0]], "lastCommittedPoint": null, "startBinding": null, "endBinding": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": "arrow"}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "m32", "x": 0, "y": 771.25, "width": 560, "height": 127.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e8590c", "backgroundColor": "#fff4e6", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 102164, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 574352, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"type": "text", "id": "m33", "x": 14, "y": 781.25, "width": 118.8, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e8590c", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 746703, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 65840, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Entropia  H", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 18, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Entropia  H", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "text", "id": "m34", "x": 14, "y": 811.25, "width": 477.0, "height": 75.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 591784, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 62497, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "H = Σ p_i · log2(1/p_i)       [bits/simbolo]\n0 <= H <= log2 q\nH = 0: fuente determinista | H = log2 q: equiprobable\nBase r:  H_r = H_2 / log2 r     (unidades de orden r)", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 15, "containerId": null, "originalText": "H = Σ p_i · log2(1/p_i)       [bits/simbolo]\n0 <= H <= log2 q\nH = 0: fuente determinista | H = log2 q: equiprobable\nBase r:  H_r = H_2 / log2 r     (unidades de orden r)", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "m35", "x": 610, "y": 558.0, "width": 560, "height": 164.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e8590c", "backgroundColor": "#fff4e6", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 649079, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 215964, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"type": "text", "id": "m36", "x": 624, "y": 568.0, "width": 270.0, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e8590c", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 520529, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 713452, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Redundancia y rendimiento", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 18, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Redundancia y rendimiento", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "text", "id": "m37", "x": 624, "y": 598.0, "width": 531.0, "height": 112.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 557550, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 448364, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Hmax = log2 q\neta = H / Hmax          R = 1 - eta\nBase r:  R = 1 - H_r / log_r(q)\n\nEj. vocales n=30: H=2,2516  Hmax=2,3219  R=3,03%\nEj. ABRACADABRA: H=2,0404 R=12,13%  cota = n·H = 22,44 bits", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 15, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Hmax = log2 q\neta = H / Hmax          R = 1 - eta\nBase r:  R = 1 - H_r / log_r(q)\n\nEj. vocales n=30: H=2,2516  Hmax=2,3219  R=3,03%\nEj. ABRACADABRA: H=2,0404 R=12,13%  cota = n·H = 22,44 bits", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "m38", "x": 890.0, "y": 722.5, "width": 0.0, "height": 30.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#868e96", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 814984, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 329408, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "points": [[0, 0], [0.0, 30.0]], "lastCommittedPoint": null, "startBinding": null, "endBinding": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": "arrow"}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "m39", "x": 610, "y": 752.5, "width": 560, "height": 127.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "#ebfbee", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 488219, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 614007, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"type": "text", "id": "m40", "x": 624, "y": 762.5, "width": 399.59999999999997, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 968299, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 475199, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Comparar con codigo de IGUAL longitud", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 18, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Comparar con codigo de IGUAL longitud", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "text", "id": "m41", "x": 624, "y": 792.5, "width": 477.0, "height": 75.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 379147, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 314329, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "L_fijo = ceil(log2 q)   ->  bits totales = n · L_fijo\ncompresion = 1 - L / L_fijo   (negativa = expande)\nAcordate: 'redundancia de la fuente' (1 - H/Hmax) y\n  'grado de compresion' (1 - L/Lfijo) son DOS cosas.", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 15, "containerId": null, "originalText": "L_fijo = ceil(log2 q)   ->  bits totales = n · L_fijo\ncompresion = 1 - L / L_fijo   (negativa = expande)\nAcordate: 'redundancia de la fuente' (1 - H/Hmax) y\n  'grado de compresion' (1 - L/Lfijo) son DOS cosas.", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "m42", "x": 1220, "y": 558.0, "width": 560, "height": 145.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "backgroundColor": "#fff5f5", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 260495, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 832968, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"type": "text", "id": "m43", "x": 1234, "y": 568.0, "width": 237.6, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 188500, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 732949, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "TRAMPAS de esta franja", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 18, "containerId": null, "originalText": "TRAMPAS de esta franja", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "text", "id": "m44", "x": 1234, "y": 598.0, "width": 486.0, "height": 93.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 817711, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 255954, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "- No mezclar las dos 'redundancias': decir cual usas.\n- Base r != 2: dividir por log_r q, no por log2 q.\n- Siempre redondear al final, no en pasos intermedios.\n- Contar bien frecuencias: una sola secuencia (la que\n  esta entre barras), no la repeticion periodica.", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 15, "containerId": null, "originalText": "- No mezclar las dos 'redundancias': decir cual usas.\n- Base r != 2: dividir por log_r q, no por log2 q.\n- Siempre redondear al final, no en pasos intermedios.\n- Contar bien frecuencias: una sola secuencia (la que\n  esta entre barras), no la repeticion periodica.", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "m45", "x": 1500.0, "y": 703.75, "width": 0.0, "height": 30.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#868e96", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 85832, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 602327, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "points": [[0, 0], [0.0, 30.0]], "lastCommittedPoint": null, "startBinding": null, "endBinding": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": "arrow"}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "m46", "x": 1220, "y": 733.75, "width": 560, "height": 108.25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#f08c00", "backgroundColor": "#fff9db", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 314835, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 550709, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"type": "text", "id": "m47", "x": 1234, "y": 743.75, "width": 410.4, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#f08c00", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 519168, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 917649, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Hilo conductor del apunte: ABRACADABRA", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 18, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Hilo conductor del apunte: ABRACADABRA", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "text", "id": "m48", "x": 1234, "y": 773.75, "width": 513.0, "height": 56.25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 360161, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 764879, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "11 simbolos, q=5:  A=5  B=2  R=2  C=1  D=1\nH = 2,0404 bits/simb  | bloque = 3 bits -> 33 bits\nSe comprime con TODOS los metodos y se compara (franja 2)", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 15, "containerId": null, "originalText": "11 simbolos, q=5:  A=5  B=2  R=2  C=1  D=1\nH = 2,0404 bits/simb  | bloque = 3 bits -> 33 bits\nSe comprime con TODOS los metodos y se compara (franja 2)", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "m49", "x": 0, "y": 962.25, "width": 1780, "height": 78, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "#2f9e44", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 470637, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 301925, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"type": "text", "id": "m50", "x": 20, "y": 970.25, "width": 826.8, "height": 32.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#ffffff", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 638540, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 76757, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "2  BLOQUE A: CODIGOS DE FUENTE (fuente independiente)", "fontSize": 26, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 26, "containerId": null, "originalText": "2  BLOQUE A: CODIGOS DE FUENTE (fuente independiente)", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "text", "id": "m51", "x": 20, "y": 1008.25, "width": 1053.0, "height": 18.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#ffffff", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 123801, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 536801, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Primero la teoria que justifica los algoritmos, despues los 3 estaticos, aritmetica, y los de diccionario/adaptativos", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 15, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Primero la teoria que justifica los algoritmos, despues los 3 estaticos, aritmetica, y los de diccionario/adaptativos", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "m52", "x": 0, "y": 1070.25, "width": 560, "height": 183.25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "#e7f5ff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 438434, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 172976, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"type": "text", "id": "m53", "x": 14, "y": 1080.25, "width": 183.6, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 793920, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 358672, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Teoria de codigos", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 18, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Teoria de codigos", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "text", "id": "m54", "x": 14, "y": 1110.25, "width": 522.0, "height": 131.25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 159368, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 978605, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Bloque (long. fija) vs no bloque | singular vs no singular\nUnivoco  >  Instantaneo (prefijo):  todo instantaneo es\n  univoco, al reves no.  Huffman/Shannon/Fano -> \n    instantaneo\n\nKraft:  Σ r^(-l_i) <= 1\n  = 1 arbol lleno (H=L) | < 1 sobra | > 1 NO existe", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 15, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Bloque (long. fija) vs no bloque | singular vs no singular\nUnivoco  >  Instantaneo (prefijo):  todo instantaneo es\n  univoco, al reves no.  Huffman/Shannon/Fano -> \n    instantaneo\n\nKraft:  Σ r^(-l_i) <= 1\n  = 1 arbol lleno (H=L) | < 1 sobra | > 1 NO existe", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "m55", "x": 280.0, "y": 1253.5, "width": 0.0, "height": 30.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#868e96", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 512715, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 442183, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "points": [[0, 0], [0.0, 30.0]], "lastCommittedPoint": null, "startBinding": null, "endBinding": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": "arrow"}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "m56", "x": 0, "y": 1283.5, "width": 560, "height": 145.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e8590c", "backgroundColor": "#fff4e6", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 41112, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 700676, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"type": "text", "id": "m57", "x": 14, "y": 1293.5, "width": 367.2, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e8590c", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 81391, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 801711, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "1er Teorema de Shannon y extension", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 18, "containerId": null, "originalText": "1er Teorema de Shannon y extension", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "text", "id": "m58", "x": 14, "y": 1323.5, "width": 495.0, "height": 93.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 585185, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 600862, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "L = Σ p_i l_i      eta = H / L      R = 1 - eta\nH <= L < H + 1\nCompacto (eta=100%) <=> p_i = r^(-l_i)\nExtension orden n: H(S^n) = n·H ;  H <= L_n/n < H + 1/n\nSiempre:  L_Huffman <= L_Fano <= L_Shannon", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 15, "containerId": null, "originalText": "L = Σ p_i l_i      eta = H / L      R = 1 - eta\nH <= L < H + 1\nCompacto (eta=100%) <=> p_i = r^(-l_i)\nExtension orden n: H(S^n) = n·H ;  H <= L_n/n < H + 1/n\nSiempre:  L_Huffman <= L_Fano <= L_Shannon", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "m59", "x": 610, "y": 1070.25, "width": 560, "height": 164.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "#ebfbee", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 827426, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 918006, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"type": "text", "id": "m60", "x": 624, "y": 1080.25, "width": 507.59999999999997, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 858106, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 328989, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "SHANNON  (estatico, doble lectura, sin perdida)", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 18, "containerId": null, "originalText": "SHANNON  (estatico, doble lectura, sin perdida)", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "text", "id": "m61", "x": 624, "y": 1110.25, "width": 531.0, "height": 112.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 356645, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 729071, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "1. Ordenar p_i de mayor a menor\n2. l_i = ceil(log2(1/p_i))\n3. FA_i = suma de las p de los simbolos ANTERIORES (1° = 0)\n4. FA a binario (x2 sucesivos), primeros l_i digitos\n5. L = Σ p_i l_i ; comparar con codigo fijo\nTRAMPA: si log2(1/p) es entero, l_i = ese entero (NO +1)", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 15, "containerId": null, "originalText": "1. Ordenar p_i de mayor a menor\n2. l_i = ceil(log2(1/p_i))\n3. FA_i = suma de las p de los simbolos ANTERIORES (1° = 0)\n4. FA a binario (x2 sucesivos), primeros l_i digitos\n5. L = Σ p_i l_i ; comparar con codigo fijo\nTRAMPA: si log2(1/p) es entero, l_i = ese entero (NO +1)", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "m62", "x": 890.0, "y": 1234.75, "width": 0.0, "height": 30.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#868e96", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 367189, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 623242, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "points": [[0, 0], [0.0, 30.0]], "lastCommittedPoint": null, "startBinding": null, "endBinding": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": "arrow"}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "m63", "x": 610, "y": 1264.75, "width": 560, "height": 145.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "#ebfbee", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 520802, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 608065, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"type": "text", "id": "m64", "x": 624, "y": 1274.75, "width": 280.8, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 835602, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 478366, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "HUFFMAN estatico  (optimo)", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 18, "containerId": null, "originalText": "HUFFMAN estatico  (optimo)", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "text", "id": "m65", "x": 624, "y": 1304.75, "width": 486.0, "height": 93.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 72104, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 880771, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "1. Ordenar  2. Sumar los 2 menores, reinsertar la suma\n3. Repetir hasta 1 nodo  4. 0/1 en ramas, raiz->hoja\nBase r: se unen r simbolos por paso\nVerificar: Kraft = 1 y ningun codigo prefijo de otro\nVarios arboles validos, todos con el mismo L", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 15, "containerId": null, "originalText": "1. Ordenar  2. Sumar los 2 menores, reinsertar la suma\n3. Repetir hasta 1 nodo  4. 0/1 en ramas, raiz->hoja\nBase r: se unen r simbolos por paso\nVerificar: Kraft = 1 y ningun codigo prefijo de otro\nVarios arboles validos, todos con el mismo L", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "m66", "x": 890.0, "y": 1410.5, "width": 0.0, "height": 30.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#868e96", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 98143, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 990570, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "points": [[0, 0], [0.0, 30.0]], "lastCommittedPoint": null, "startBinding": null, "endBinding": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": "arrow"}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "m67", "x": 610, "y": 1440.5, "width": 560, "height": 127.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "#ebfbee", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 283052, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 497129, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"type": "text", "id": "m68", "x": 624, "y": 1450.5, "width": 43.199999999999996, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 730902, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 696415, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "FANO", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 18, "containerId": null, "originalText": "FANO", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "text", "id": "m69", "x": 624, "y": 1480.5, "width": 522.0, "height": 75.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 68158, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 63617, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "1. Ordenar desc  2. Cortar en 2 grupos con suma ~ 0,5\n3. 0 al de arriba, 1 al de abajo  4. Repetir en cada grupo\n2 cortes igual de buenos: probar ambos\nTRAMPA: Fano NO es Huffman (se penalizo en recuperatorio)", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 15, "containerId": null, "originalText": "1. Ordenar desc  2. Cortar en 2 grupos con suma ~ 0,5\n3. 0 al de arriba, 1 al de abajo  4. Repetir en cada grupo\n2 cortes igual de buenos: probar ambos\nTRAMPA: Fano NO es Huffman (se penalizo en recuperatorio)", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "m70", "x": 1220, "y": 1070.25, "width": 560, "height": 239.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "#ebfbee", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 766677, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 735568, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"type": "text", "id": "m71", "x": 1234, "y": 1080.25, "width": 248.39999999999998, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 324647, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 678564, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "CODIFICACION ARITMETICA", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 18, "containerId": null, "originalText": "CODIFICACION ARITMETICA", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "text", "id": "m72", "x": 1234, "y": 1110.25, "width": 513.0, "height": 187.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 606021, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 714329, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Intervalo [Q,R) de cada simbolo = acumulada (MISMO orden)\nInicio [0,1).  Por simbolo:  rango = high - low\n   low' = low + rango·Q_s     high' = low + rango·R_s\nSalida: cualquier numero del intervalo final\nBits ~ -log2(Π p_i) = -log2(ancho)  (casi = n·H)\n\n'3 decimales en TODOS los pasos, hasta que no se\ndiferencien las cotas': redondear CADA cota; el simbolo\nen que low = high ya no se codifica (codificar hasta el\nanterior). Escribir 'no se puede discernir'.", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 15, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Intervalo [Q,R) de cada simbolo = acumulada (MISMO orden)\nInicio [0,1).  Por simbolo:  rango = high - low\n   low' = low + rango·Q_s     high' = low + rango·R_s\nSalida: cualquier numero del intervalo final\nBits ~ -log2(Π p_i) = -log2(ancho)  (casi = n·H)\n\n'3 decimales en TODOS los pasos, hasta que no se\ndiferencien las cotas': redondear CADA cota; el simbolo\nen que low = high ya no se codifica (codificar hasta el\nanterior). Escribir 'no se puede discernir'.", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "m73", "x": 1500.0, "y": 1309.75, "width": 0.0, "height": 30.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#868e96", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 861851, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 467289, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "points": [[0, 0], [0.0, 30.0]], "lastCommittedPoint": null, "startBinding": null, "endBinding": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": "arrow"}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "m74", "x": 1220, "y": 1339.75, "width": 560, "height": 108.25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#f08c00", "backgroundColor": "#fff9db", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 298421, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 751439, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"type": "text", "id": "m75", "x": 1234, "y": 1349.75, "width": 432.0, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#f08c00", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 404532, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 930130, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Cuando coinciden los 3 metodos (teorica)", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 18, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Cuando coinciden los 3 metodos (teorica)", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "text", "id": "m76", "x": 1234, "y": 1379.75, "width": 522.0, "height": 56.25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 701134, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 363862, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "p_i = 2^(-l_i) y SUMAN 1. Ej: 1/2,1/4,1/8,1/16,1/16\nLas 2 ultimas son iguales. Uniforme NO sirve (salvo q=2^k)\nKraft = 1, H = L, eta = 100%", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 15, "containerId": null, "originalText": "p_i = 2^(-l_i) y SUMAN 1. Ej: 1/2,1/4,1/8,1/16,1/16\nLas 2 ultimas son iguales. Uniforme NO sirve (salvo q=2^k)\nKraft = 1, H = L, eta = 100%", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "m77", "x": 0, "y": 1631.5, "width": 560, "height": 202.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "#ebfbee", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 23659, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 986342, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"type": "text", "id": "m78", "x": 14, "y": 1641.5, "width": 399.59999999999997, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 484123, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 372732, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "LEMPEL-ZIV (LZ77, ventana deslizante)", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 18, "containerId": null, "originalText": "LEMPEL-ZIV (LZ77, ventana deslizante)", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "text", "id": "m79", "x": 14, "y": 1671.5, "width": 522.0, "height": 150.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 176212, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 640596, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Sin tabla de probabilidades: el diccionario es lo ya leido\nBuffer de busqueda (ventana) | buffer de mirar adelante\n1. Buscar coincidencia MAS LARGA con lo que falta\n2. Emitir (desplazamiento, longitud, siguiente simbolo)\n   sin coincidencia: (0,0,s)\n3. Avanzar longitud+1.  Desplazamiento hacia ATRAS,\n   maximo = tamano de ventana\nABRACADABRA: (0,0,A)(0,0,B)(0,0,R)(2,1,C)(4,1,D)(6,4,eof)", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 15, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Sin tabla de probabilidades: el diccionario es lo ya leido\nBuffer de busqueda (ventana) | buffer de mirar adelante\n1. Buscar coincidencia MAS LARGA con lo que falta\n2. Emitir (desplazamiento, longitud, siguiente simbolo)\n   sin coincidencia: (0,0,s)\n3. Avanzar longitud+1.  Desplazamiento hacia ATRAS,\n   maximo = tamano de ventana\nABRACADABRA: (0,0,A)(0,0,B)(0,0,R)(2,1,C)(4,1,D)(6,4,eof)", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "m80", "x": 280.0, "y": 1833.5, "width": 0.0, "height": 30.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#868e96", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 122784, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 517675, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "points": [[0, 0], [0.0, 30.0]], "lastCommittedPoint": null, "startBinding": null, "endBinding": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": "arrow"}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "m81", "x": 0, "y": 1863.5, "width": 560, "height": 183.25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "#ebfbee", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 61819, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 228808, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"type": "text", "id": "m82", "x": 14, "y": 1873.5, "width": 32.4, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 805551, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 301395, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "LZW", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 18, "containerId": null, "originalText": "LZW", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "text", "id": "m83", "x": 14, "y": 1903.5, "width": 513.0, "height": 131.25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 135624, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 774231, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Diccionario inicial = alfabeto (A=65,B=66...). I = cadena\n1. Mientras I+x este en el dicc: seguir acumulando\n2. Si no: EMITIR indice(I), agregar I+x, I = x\n3. Al final emitir indice(I)\nABRACADABRA: 65 66 82 65 67 65 68 256 258 (9 codigos)\nAncho en bits segun tamano final del dicc.\nOrden con Huffman: PRIMERO LZW, DESPUES Huffman", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 15, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Diccionario inicial = alfabeto (A=65,B=66...). I = cadena\n1. Mientras I+x este en el dicc: seguir acumulando\n2. Si no: EMITIR indice(I), agregar I+x, I = x\n3. Al final emitir indice(I)\nABRACADABRA: 65 66 82 65 67 65 68 256 258 (9 codigos)\nAncho en bits segun tamano final del dicc.\nOrden con Huffman: PRIMERO LZW, DESPUES Huffman", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "m84", "x": 610, "y": 1631.5, "width": 560, "height": 277.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "#ebfbee", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 259643, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 417226, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"type": "text", "id": "m85", "x": 624, "y": 1641.5, "width": 432.0, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 409941, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 961352, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "HUFFMAN DINAMICO (adaptativo, 1 lectura)", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 18, "containerId": null, "originalText": "HUFFMAN DINAMICO (adaptativo, 1 lectura)", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "text", "id": "m86", "x": 624, "y": 1671.5, "width": 531.0, "height": 225.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 913753, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 520626, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Arbol inicial = solo NYT (Not Yet Transmitted), a la IZQ \n  (0)\nPor simbolo:\n a) YA esta: emitir su codigo actual, peso +1\n b) NUEVO: emitir codigo del NYT + codigo fijo (ceil(log2 \n   q)\n    bits). NYT se abre: NYT nuevo (izq) + hoja peso 1 (der)\n c) Sumar +1 a la hoja y a todos los ancestros hasta raiz\n d) SIBLING PROPERTY de abajo hacia arriba (ver cuadro)\nDecodificar: bajar por el arbol; si cae en NYT leer el \n  fijo;\n  actualizar en espejo igual que el emisor", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 15, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Arbol inicial = solo NYT (Not Yet Transmitted), a la IZQ \n  (0)\nPor simbolo:\n a) YA esta: emitir su codigo actual, peso +1\n b) NUEVO: emitir codigo del NYT + codigo fijo (ceil(log2 \n   q)\n    bits). NYT se abre: NYT nuevo (izq) + hoja peso 1 (der)\n c) Sumar +1 a la hoja y a todos los ancestros hasta raiz\n d) SIBLING PROPERTY de abajo hacia arriba (ver cuadro)\nDecodificar: bajar por el arbol; si cae en NYT leer el \n  fijo;\n  actualizar en espejo igual que el emisor", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "m87", "x": 890.0, "y": 1908.5, "width": 0.0, "height": 30.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#868e96", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 84496, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 174448, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "points": [[0, 0], [0.0, 30.0]], "lastCommittedPoint": null, "startBinding": null, "endBinding": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": "arrow"}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "m88", "x": 610, "y": 1938.5, "width": 560, "height": 258.25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e8590c", "backgroundColor": "#fff4e6", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 471008, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 421155, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"type": "text", "id": "m89", "x": 624, "y": 1948.5, "width": 291.59999999999997, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e8590c", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 576130, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 291336, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Sibling Property (Gallager)", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 18, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Sibling Property (Gallager)", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "text", "id": "m90", "x": 624, "y": 1978.5, "width": 531.0, "height": 206.25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 926296, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 143578, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Numerar nodos: abajo->arriba, izq->der. Pesos NO \n  decrecientes\nAntes de sumar +1 a q: buscar el lider (mayor numero con\n  su mismo peso). Si no es q ni su padre -> SWAP q<->lider\nObjetivo: el arbol sigue siendo de HUFFMAN OPTIMO \n  (Gallager:\n  arbol de Huffman <=> sibling) sin reconstruirlo; emisor y\n  receptor quedan sincronizados sin tabla\nRespuesta teorica = 2 cosas: EN QUE PASOS y PARA QUE\nABRACADABRA: swaps en pasos 3,5,7,9 -> 35 bits\n'aeieo': pasos 3,4,5 -> 20 bits (15 fijo: expande)", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 15, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Numerar nodos: abajo->arriba, izq->der. Pesos NO \n  decrecientes\nAntes de sumar +1 a q: buscar el lider (mayor numero con\n  su mismo peso). Si no es q ni su padre -> SWAP q<->lider\nObjetivo: el arbol sigue siendo de HUFFMAN OPTIMO \n  (Gallager:\n  arbol de Huffman <=> sibling) sin reconstruirlo; emisor y\n  receptor quedan sincronizados sin tabla\nRespuesta teorica = 2 cosas: EN QUE PASOS y PARA QUE\nABRACADABRA: swaps en pasos 3,5,7,9 -> 35 bits\n'aeieo': pasos 3,4,5 -> 20 bits (15 fijo: expande)", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "m91", "x": 1220, "y": 1631.5, "width": 560, "height": 202.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "#ebfbee", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 859078, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 451435, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"type": "text", "id": "m92", "x": 1234, "y": 1641.5, "width": 432.0, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 905954, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 576948, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "PPM-C (modelo por contexto + aritmetica)", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 18, "containerId": null, "originalText": "PPM-C (modelo por contexto + aritmetica)", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "text", "id": "m93", "x": 1234, "y": 1671.5, "width": 513.0, "height": 150.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 291946, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 740711, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Contexto de orden n -> n-1 -> ... -> 0 -> -1 (uniforme)\nSi el simbolo nunca aparecio en ese contexto: ESC y bajar\nU = simbolos DISTINTOS vistos en el contexto\n  P(ESC) = U / (total + U)     P(s) = f(s) / (total + U)\nDespues un codificador aritmetico con renormalizacion\n  E1 (high<=0,5: emitir 0) | E2 (low>=0,5: emitir 1) |\n  E3 (zona media: bit pendiente)\nABRACADABRA: 49 bits vs 66 (bloque base 64) = -25,8%", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 15, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Contexto de orden n -> n-1 -> ... -> 0 -> -1 (uniforme)\nSi el simbolo nunca aparecio en ese contexto: ESC y bajar\nU = simbolos DISTINTOS vistos en el contexto\n  P(ESC) = U / (total + U)     P(s) = f(s) / (total + U)\nDespues un codificador aritmetico con renormalizacion\n  E1 (high<=0,5: emitir 0) | E2 (low>=0,5: emitir 1) |\n  E3 (zona media: bit pendiente)\nABRACADABRA: 49 bits vs 66 (bloque base 64) = -25,8%", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "m94", "x": 1500.0, "y": 1833.5, "width": 0.0, "height": 30.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#868e96", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 435470, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 376199, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "points": [[0, 0], [0.0, 30.0]], "lastCommittedPoint": null, "startBinding": null, "endBinding": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": "arrow"}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "m95", "x": 1220, "y": 1863.5, "width": 560, "height": 202.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "#ebfbee", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 715888, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 927144, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"type": "text", "id": "m96", "x": 1234, "y": 1873.5, "width": 475.2, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 398922, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 241961, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "BWT (Burrows-Wheeler) - no comprime, prepara", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 18, "containerId": null, "originalText": "BWT (Burrows-Wheeler) - no comprime, prepara", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "text", "id": "m97", "x": 1234, "y": 1903.5, "width": 531.0, "height": 150.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 158253, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 87016, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Directa: agregar $ (menor que todo) -> n rotaciones\n  -> ordenar -> ULTIMA columna.  ABRACADABRA$ -> \n    ARD$RCAAAABB\nInversa: escribir L; pegar L a la IZQUIERDA de la tabla,\n  reordenar, repetir n veces; fila que termina en $ = \n    original\nPara que: agrupa iguales -> RLE/Huffman/Markov comprimen\n  mejor (matriz con valores ~1, menor entropia condicional)", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 15, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Directa: agregar $ (menor que todo) -> n rotaciones\n  -> ordenar -> ULTIMA columna.  ABRACADABRA$ -> \n    ARD$RCAAAABB\nInversa: escribir L; pegar L a la IZQUIERDA de la tabla,\n  reordenar, repetir n veces; fila que termina en $ = \n    original\nPara que: agrupa iguales -> RLE/Huffman/Markov comprimen\n  mejor (matriz con valores ~1, menor entropia condicional)", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "m98", "x": 0, "y": 2250.75, "width": 1780, "height": 190, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#f08c00", "backgroundColor": "#fff9db", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 184778, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 158648, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"type": "text", "id": "m99", "x": 14, "y": 2260.75, "width": 907.1999999999999, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#f08c00", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 243225, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 690505, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "TABLA COMPARATIVA sobre ABRACADABRA (11 simbolos, H = 2,0404, cota n·H = 22,44 bits)", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 18, "containerId": null, "originalText": "TABLA COMPARATIVA sobre ABRACADABRA (11 simbolos, H = 2,0404, cota n·H = 22,44 bits)", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "text", "id": "m100", "x": 14, "y": 2292.75, "width": 1251.0, "height": 75.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 244671, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 12650, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Bloque 33 bits (3,000 b/s) | Shannon 30 (2,727) | Huffman = Fano 23 (2,091, eta 97,6%) | Aritmetica ~23-24 (pegada a la cota)\nHuffman dinamico 35 (3,18: paga el aprendizaje) | PPM-C 49 (comparar contra 66 de su propio alfabeto de 64) | LZ77 6 tuplas | LZW 9 codigos\nConclusiones: Huffman ~ Fano <= Aritmetica <= cota | Shannon el mas simple y el menos eficiente | adaptativos y diccionario\npagan costo de aprendizaje en mensajes cortos pero NO transmiten tabla | PPM-C el mas potente | BWT solo reordena", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 15, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Bloque 33 bits (3,000 b/s) | Shannon 30 (2,727) | Huffman = Fano 23 (2,091, eta 97,6%) | Aritmetica ~23-24 (pegada a la cota)\nHuffman dinamico 35 (3,18: paga el aprendizaje) | PPM-C 49 (comparar contra 66 de su propio alfabeto de 64) | LZ77 6 tuplas | LZW 9 codigos\nConclusiones: Huffman ~ Fano <= Aritmetica <= cota | Shannon el mas simple y el menos eficiente | adaptativos y diccionario\npagan costo de aprendizaje en mensajes cortos pero NO transmiten tabla | PPM-C el mas potente | BWT solo reordena", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "text", "id": "m101", "x": 14, "y": 2390.75, "width": 1233.0, "height": 18.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 508521, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 871465, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Estaticos = de DOBLE lectura y SIN perdida | A mayor redundancia, mayor compresion posible | Comprimido: mas entropia y menos redundancia", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 15, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Estaticos = de DOBLE lectura y SIN perdida | A mayor redundancia, mayor compresion posible | Comprimido: mas entropia y menos redundancia", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "m102", "x": 0, "y": 2490.75, "width": 1780, "height": 78, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "backgroundColor": "#6741d9", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 617741, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 191201, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"type": "text", "id": "m103", "x": 20, "y": 2498.75, "width": 811.1999999999999, "height": 32.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#ffffff", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 275510, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 295626, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "3  BLOQUE B: FUENTE DE MARKOV (dependiente, orden 1)", "fontSize": 26, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 26, "containerId": null, "originalText": "3  BLOQUE B: FUENTE DE MARKOV (dependiente, orden 1)", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "text", "id": "m104", "x": 20, "y": 2536.75, "width": 1071.0, "height": 18.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#ffffff", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 4293, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 152753, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Se lee en orden: matriz -> ergodicidad -> estacionaria -> entropia -> probabilidad de cadena -> codificacion por estado", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 15, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Se lee en orden: matriz -> ergodicidad -> estacionaria -> entropia -> probabilidad de cadena -> codificacion por estado", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "m105", "x": 0, "y": 2598.75, "width": 560, "height": 145.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "#ebfbee", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 439298, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 560560, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"type": "text", "id": "m106", "x": 14, "y": 2608.75, "width": 334.8, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 387191, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 639435, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Paso 1 - Matriz de transicion P", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 18, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Paso 1 - Matriz de transicion P", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "text", "id": "m107", "x": 14, "y": 2638.75, "width": 468.0, "height": 93.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 593852, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 334089, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Contar cada PAR consecutivo s_i s_j de la secuencia\n(CIERRE CIRCULAR: el ultimo simbolo pasa al primero)\nP_ij = #(s_i s_j) / #(s_i como ORIGEN)\nCada fila suma 1.   TRAMPA: NO dividir por n\n(eso es probabilidad conjunta, no Markov)", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 15, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Contar cada PAR consecutivo s_i s_j de la secuencia\n(CIERRE CIRCULAR: el ultimo simbolo pasa al primero)\nP_ij = #(s_i s_j) / #(s_i como ORIGEN)\nCada fila suma 1.   TRAMPA: NO dividir por n\n(eso es probabilidad conjunta, no Markov)", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "m108", "x": 280.0, "y": 2744.5, "width": 0.0, "height": 30.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#868e96", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 999396, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 131588, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "points": [[0, 0], [0.0, 30.0]], "lastCommittedPoint": null, "startBinding": null, "endBinding": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": "arrow"}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "m109", "x": 0, "y": 2774.5, "width": 560, "height": 164.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "#ebfbee", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 724036, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 900939, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"type": "text", "id": "m110", "x": 14, "y": 2784.5, "width": 216.0, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 540532, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 996383, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Paso 2 - Ergodicidad", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 18, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Paso 2 - Ergodicidad", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "text", "id": "m111", "x": 14, "y": 2814.5, "width": 504.0, "height": 112.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 647593, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 686783, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Grafo: flecha i->j si P_ij > 0\nErgodica = irreducible (de todo estado se llega a todo\n  estado) + aperiodica  (o alguna P^k tiene TODO > 0)\nNo ergodica: estado absorbente o grupo cerrado\n  ej. [[1,0],[0,5 0,5]] -> el 1 es absorbente\nTRAMPA: 'tiene ceros' NO alcanza para decir que no lo es", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 15, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Grafo: flecha i->j si P_ij > 0\nErgodica = irreducible (de todo estado se llega a todo\n  estado) + aperiodica  (o alguna P^k tiene TODO > 0)\nNo ergodica: estado absorbente o grupo cerrado\n  ej. [[1,0],[0,5 0,5]] -> el 1 es absorbente\nTRAMPA: 'tiene ceros' NO alcanza para decir que no lo es", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "m112", "x": 610, "y": 2598.75, "width": 560, "height": 145.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "#ebfbee", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 709048, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 775721, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"type": "text", "id": "m113", "x": 624, "y": 2608.75, "width": 399.59999999999997, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 56616, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 478826, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Paso 3 - Distribucion estacionaria pi", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 18, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Paso 3 - Distribucion estacionaria pi", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "text", "id": "m114", "x": 624, "y": 2638.75, "width": 504.0, "height": 93.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 943229, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 913289, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "pi · P = pi      Σ pi_i = 1\n(ergodica -> pi es unica = frecuencia a largo plazo)\nMetodos: sistema de ecuaciones + normalizar |\n  elevar P a potencia grande | autovector de autovalor 1\nMatriz estacionaria = q filas iguales a pi", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 15, "containerId": null, "originalText": "pi · P = pi      Σ pi_i = 1\n(ergodica -> pi es unica = frecuencia a largo plazo)\nMetodos: sistema de ecuaciones + normalizar |\n  elevar P a potencia grande | autovector de autovalor 1\nMatriz estacionaria = q filas iguales a pi", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "m115", "x": 890.0, "y": 2744.5, "width": 0.0, "height": 30.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#868e96", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 817858, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 998126, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "points": [[0, 0], [0.0, 30.0]], "lastCommittedPoint": null, "startBinding": null, "endBinding": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": "arrow"}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "m116", "x": 610, "y": 2774.5, "width": 560, "height": 145.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e8590c", "backgroundColor": "#fff4e6", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 916994, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 713635, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"type": "text", "id": "m117", "x": 624, "y": 2784.5, "width": 291.59999999999997, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e8590c", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 836631, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 586439, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Paso 4 - Entropia de Markov", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 18, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Paso 4 - Entropia de Markov", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "text", "id": "m118", "x": 624, "y": 2814.5, "width": 441.0, "height": 93.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 411440, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 417407, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "H(S_M) = Σ_i pi_i · H(fila i)\nH(fila i) = Σ_j P_ij · log2(1/P_ij)\nPONDERAR por pi (no por 1/q, no sumar sin pesos)\nH(S_M) <= H(S): igualdad solo si filas todas = pi\nEj vocales: H(S)=2,2516  H(S_M)=1,830", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 15, "containerId": null, "originalText": "H(S_M) = Σ_i pi_i · H(fila i)\nH(fila i) = Σ_j P_ij · log2(1/P_ij)\nPONDERAR por pi (no por 1/q, no sumar sin pesos)\nH(S_M) <= H(S): igualdad solo si filas todas = pi\nEj vocales: H(S)=2,2516  H(S_M)=1,830", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "m119", "x": 890.0, "y": 2920.25, "width": 0.0, "height": 30.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#868e96", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 418360, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 413265, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "points": [[0, 0], [0.0, 30.0]], "lastCommittedPoint": null, "startBinding": null, "endBinding": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": "arrow"}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "m120", "x": 610, "y": 2950.25, "width": 560, "height": 89.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e8590c", "backgroundColor": "#fff4e6", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 108567, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 504914, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"type": "text", "id": "m121", "x": 624, "y": 2960.25, "width": 378.0, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e8590c", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 665101, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 419895, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Paso 5 - Probabilidad de una cadena", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 18, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Paso 5 - Probabilidad de una cadena", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "text", "id": "m122", "x": 624, "y": 2990.25, "width": 495.0, "height": 37.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 65272, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 199869, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "p(s1 s2 ... sk) = pi(s1) · P(s2|s1) · ... · P(sk|s_k-1)\nEj. p(eeii) = pi(e)·P(e|e)·P(i|e)·P(i|i)", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 15, "containerId": null, "originalText": "p(s1 s2 ... sk) = pi(s1) · P(s2|s1) · ... · P(sk|s_k-1)\nEj. p(eeii) = pi(e)·P(e|e)·P(i|e)·P(i|i)", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "m123", "x": 1220, "y": 2598.75, "width": 560, "height": 220.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "#ebfbee", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 70620, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 218905, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"type": "text", "id": "m124", "x": 1234, "y": 2608.75, "width": 442.8, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 462031, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 170188, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Paso 6 - Codificar como Markov de orden 1", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 18, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Paso 6 - Codificar como Markov de orden 1", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "text", "id": "m125", "x": 1234, "y": 2638.75, "width": 513.0, "height": 168.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 115269, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 356573, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "(Huffman / Fano / Shannon 'como fuente de Markov')\n1. Para CADA fila: tomar solo sus P > 0 y armar el codigo\n   (fila con 1 solo sucesor, p=1 -> 0 bits)\n2. 1er simbolo del mensaje: codigo de bloque\n   desde el 2°: codigo de la fila del simbolo anterior\n3. L_M = Σ pi_i · L_i        eta = H(S_M) / L_M\n4. Comparar con bloque, con el indep. y con el mismo\n   algoritmo en version independiente\nL_M puede quedar < H(S): NO viola Shannon (usa el estado)", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 15, "containerId": null, "originalText": "(Huffman / Fano / Shannon 'como fuente de Markov')\n1. Para CADA fila: tomar solo sus P > 0 y armar el codigo\n   (fila con 1 solo sucesor, p=1 -> 0 bits)\n2. 1er simbolo del mensaje: codigo de bloque\n   desde el 2°: codigo de la fila del simbolo anterior\n3. L_M = Σ pi_i · L_i        eta = H(S_M) / L_M\n4. Comparar con bloque, con el indep. y con el mismo\n   algoritmo en version independiente\nL_M puede quedar < H(S): NO viola Shannon (usa el estado)", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "m126", "x": 1500.0, "y": 2819.5, "width": 0.0, "height": 30.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#868e96", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 629909, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 55130, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "points": [[0, 0], [0.0, 30.0]], "lastCommittedPoint": null, "startBinding": null, "endBinding": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": "arrow"}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "m127", "x": 1220, "y": 2849.5, "width": 560, "height": 127.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#f08c00", "backgroundColor": "#fff9db", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 107353, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 245, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"type": "text", "id": "m128", "x": 1234, "y": 2859.5, "width": 475.2, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#f08c00", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 594316, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 158613, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Independiente vs Markov - quien va con quien", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 18, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Independiente vs Markov - quien va con quien", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "text", "id": "m129", "x": 1234, "y": 2889.5, "width": 513.0, "height": 75.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 562686, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 106394, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Codigo sobre frecuencias globales: L vs H(S)\nCodigo por estado:                 L_M vs H(S_M)\nMarkov orden m: estado = ultimos m simbolos (q^m estados)\nLZ, LZW, aritmetica, Huffman dinamico: NO usan la matriz", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 15, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Codigo sobre frecuencias globales: L vs H(S)\nCodigo por estado:                 L_M vs H(S_M)\nMarkov orden m: estado = ultimos m simbolos (q^m estados)\nLZ, LZW, aritmetica, Huffman dinamico: NO usan la matriz", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "m130", "x": 1500.0, "y": 2976.5, "width": 0.0, "height": 30.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#868e96", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 995045, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 381273, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "points": [[0, 0], [0.0, 30.0]], "lastCommittedPoint": null, "startBinding": null, "endBinding": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": "arrow"}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "m131", "x": 1220, "y": 3006.5, "width": 560, "height": 89.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#f08c00", "backgroundColor": "#fff9db", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 643551, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 26740, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"type": "text", "id": "m132", "x": 1234, "y": 3016.5, "width": 464.4, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#f08c00", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 73732, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 916804, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Si se hace BWT antes de la matriz (teorica)", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 18, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Si se hace BWT antes de la matriz (teorica)", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "text", "id": "m133", "x": 1234, "y": 3046.5, "width": 522.0, "height": 37.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 218055, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 643899, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Resultados MEJORES: agrupa iguales -> P con valores ~1,\nmenor H condicional, L mas cerca de H. JUSTIFICAR siempre.", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 15, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Resultados MEJORES: agrupa iguales -> P con valores ~1,\nmenor H condicional, L mas cerca de H. JUSTIFICAR siempre.", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "m134", "x": 0, "y": 3160.0, "width": 1780, "height": 78, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#0c8599", "backgroundColor": "#0c8599", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 394506, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 155767, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"type": "text", "id": "m135", "x": 20, "y": 3168.0, "width": 514.8, "height": 32.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#ffffff", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 665227, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 264512, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "4  BLOQUE C: CANAL DE INFORMACION", "fontSize": 26, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 26, "containerId": null, "originalText": "4  BLOQUE C: CANAL DE INFORMACION", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "text", "id": "m136", "x": 20, "y": 3206.0, "width": 729.0, "height": 18.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#ffffff", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 364265, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 631536, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Orden fijo de cuentas: matriz -> p(a) -> p(b) -> entropias -> I(A;B) -> capacidad", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 15, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Orden fijo de cuentas: matriz -> p(a) -> p(b) -> entropias -> I(A;B) -> capacidad", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "m137", "x": 0, "y": 3268.0, "width": 560, "height": 164.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "#ebfbee", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 381854, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 497184, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"type": "text", "id": "m138", "x": 14, "y": 3278.0, "width": 356.4, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 128810, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 120957, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Paso 1 - Matriz del canal  P(B|A)", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 18, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Paso 1 - Matriz del canal  P(B|A)", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "text", "id": "m139", "x": 14, "y": 3308.0, "width": 531.0, "height": 112.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 890175, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 511777, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Filas = entrada a_i, columnas = salida b_j, cada fila suma \n  1\nUniforme: todas las filas son permutacion de la 1ª\nSimetrico: ademas las columnas | BSC: [[1-p,p],[p,1-p]]\n'Es simetrico?' -> mirar si cada fila es permutacion de\n  las otras (ej [[0,65 0,35],[0,05 0,95]] NO lo es)", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 15, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Filas = entrada a_i, columnas = salida b_j, cada fila suma \n  1\nUniforme: todas las filas son permutacion de la 1ª\nSimetrico: ademas las columnas | BSC: [[1-p,p],[p,1-p]]\n'Es simetrico?' -> mirar si cada fila es permutacion de\n  las otras (ej [[0,65 0,35],[0,05 0,95]] NO lo es)", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "m140", "x": 280.0, "y": 3432.5, "width": 0.0, "height": 30.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#868e96", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 488626, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 503731, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "points": [[0, 0], [0.0, 30.0]], "lastCommittedPoint": null, "startBinding": null, "endBinding": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": "arrow"}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "m141", "x": 0, "y": 3462.5, "width": 560, "height": 145.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "#ebfbee", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 507338, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 327001, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"type": "text", "id": "m142", "x": 14, "y": 3472.5, "width": 248.39999999999998, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 90057, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 151119, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Paso 2 - Probabilidades", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 18, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Paso 2 - Probabilidades", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "text", "id": "m143", "x": 14, "y": 3502.5, "width": 495.0, "height": 93.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 107152, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 786091, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "p(a_i): las del enunciado (equiprobables si piden \n  capacidad)\np(b_j) = Σ_i p(a_i)·P(b_j|a_i)   (vector p(A) x matriz)\nBayes:  P(a_i|b_j) = p(a_i)·P(b_j|a_i) / p(b_j)\nVerificar que p(B) suma 1", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 15, "containerId": null, "originalText": "p(a_i): las del enunciado (equiprobables si piden \n  capacidad)\np(b_j) = Σ_i p(a_i)·P(b_j|a_i)   (vector p(A) x matriz)\nBayes:  P(a_i|b_j) = p(a_i)·P(b_j|a_i) / p(b_j)\nVerificar que p(B) suma 1", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "m144", "x": 610, "y": 3268.0, "width": 560, "height": 164.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e8590c", "backgroundColor": "#fff4e6", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 359280, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 776315, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"type": "text", "id": "m145", "x": 624, "y": 3278.0, "width": 259.2, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e8590c", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 277618, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 501872, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Paso 3 - Las 4 entropias", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 18, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Paso 3 - Las 4 entropias", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "text", "id": "m146", "x": 624, "y": 3308.0, "width": 504.0, "height": 112.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 869118, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 725675, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "H(A)   con p(a_i)  (dadas)         H(B) con p(b_j) \n  CALCULADAS\nH(B|A) = Σ_i p(a_i)·H(fila i)    RUIDO  (pesar por TODAS\n   las filas; uniforme: H(una fila), sin dividir por q)\nH(A|B) = Σ_j p(b_j)·H(col j tras Bayes)  EQUIVOCACION\nH(A,B) = H(A) + H(B|A) = H(B) + H(A|B)", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 15, "containerId": null, "originalText": "H(A)   con p(a_i)  (dadas)         H(B) con p(b_j) \n  CALCULADAS\nH(B|A) = Σ_i p(a_i)·H(fila i)    RUIDO  (pesar por TODAS\n   las filas; uniforme: H(una fila), sin dividir por q)\nH(A|B) = Σ_j p(b_j)·H(col j tras Bayes)  EQUIVOCACION\nH(A,B) = H(A) + H(B|A) = H(B) + H(A|B)", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "m147", "x": 890.0, "y": 3432.5, "width": 0.0, "height": 30.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#868e96", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 169281, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 541416, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "points": [[0, 0], [0.0, 30.0]], "lastCommittedPoint": null, "startBinding": null, "endBinding": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": "arrow"}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "m148", "x": 610, "y": 3462.5, "width": 560, "height": 145.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e8590c", "backgroundColor": "#fff4e6", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 24218, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 215184, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"type": "text", "id": "m149", "x": 624, "y": 3472.5, "width": 280.8, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e8590c", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 997181, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 998267, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Paso 4 - Informacion mutua", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 18, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Paso 4 - Informacion mutua", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "text", "id": "m150", "x": 624, "y": 3502.5, "width": 477.0, "height": 93.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 553919, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 379325, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "I(A;B) = H(B) - H(B|A) = H(A) - H(A|B)\n         = H(A) + H(B) - H(A,B)\n0 <= I <= min(H(A), H(B)) <= log2 q    NUNCA negativa\nI = 0  <=>  A y B independientes\nEj. BSC 0,85 con p(0)=0,7:  I = 0,333 bits", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 15, "containerId": null, "originalText": "I(A;B) = H(B) - H(B|A) = H(A) - H(A|B)\n         = H(A) + H(B) - H(A,B)\n0 <= I <= min(H(A), H(B)) <= log2 q    NUNCA negativa\nI = 0  <=>  A y B independientes\nEj. BSC 0,85 con p(0)=0,7:  I = 0,333 bits", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "m151", "x": 890.0, "y": 3608.25, "width": 0.0, "height": 30.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#868e96", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 153724, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 723589, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "points": [[0, 0], [0.0, 30.0]], "lastCommittedPoint": null, "startBinding": null, "endBinding": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": "arrow"}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "m152", "x": 610, "y": 3638.25, "width": 560, "height": 183.25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e8590c", "backgroundColor": "#fff4e6", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 569558, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 958552, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"type": "text", "id": "m153", "x": 624, "y": 3648.25, "width": 194.4, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e8590c", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 28357, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 794971, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Paso 5 - Capacidad", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 18, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Paso 5 - Capacidad", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "text", "id": "m154", "x": 624, "y": 3678.25, "width": 531.0, "height": 131.25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 553763, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 312570, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "C = max_p(a) I(A;B)\nBSC:         C = 1 - H(p)        (p=0,05 -> 0,714 ; p=0,1 \n  -> 0,531)\nSimetrico qxq: C = log2 q - H(fila)    (equiprobable)\n  ternario 0,8/0,15/0,05 -> 0,7008 ; 0,8/0,1/0,1 -> 0,663\nAsimetrico: MAXIMIZAR sobre p(a) (NO usar 1-H(p))\n  conviene enviar MAS el simbolo de la fila con menos ruido", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 15, "containerId": null, "originalText": "C = max_p(a) I(A;B)\nBSC:         C = 1 - H(p)        (p=0,05 -> 0,714 ; p=0,1 \n  -> 0,531)\nSimetrico qxq: C = log2 q - H(fila)    (equiprobable)\n  ternario 0,8/0,15/0,05 -> 0,7008 ; 0,8/0,1/0,1 -> 0,663\nAsimetrico: MAXIMIZAR sobre p(a) (NO usar 1-H(p))\n  conviene enviar MAS el simbolo de la fila con menos ruido", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "m155", "x": 1220, "y": 3268.0, "width": 560, "height": 164.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#f08c00", "backgroundColor": "#fff9db", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 674148, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 905262, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"type": "text", "id": "m156", "x": 1234, "y": 3278.0, "width": 334.8, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#f08c00", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 95432, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 730016, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Casos extremos (teoricas fijas)", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 18, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Casos extremos (teoricas fijas)", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "text", "id": "m157", "x": 1234, "y": 3308.0, "width": 495.0, "height": 112.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 886517, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 273800, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "MEJOR canal: identidad. H(B|A)=0, I=H(A), C = log2 q\n   (binario 1 ; ternario 1,585)\nPEOR canal: todo 1/q. H(B|A)=H(B), I=0, C=0\n   emisor y receptor INDEPENDIENTES\nPeor BSC: p = 0,5  ->  C = 0\nBSC con p=1: invierte siempre -> C = 1 (sigue perfecto)", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 15, "containerId": null, "originalText": "MEJOR canal: identidad. H(B|A)=0, I=H(A), C = log2 q\n   (binario 1 ; ternario 1,585)\nPEOR canal: todo 1/q. H(B|A)=H(B), I=0, C=0\n   emisor y receptor INDEPENDIENTES\nPeor BSC: p = 0,5  ->  C = 0\nBSC con p=1: invierte siempre -> C = 1 (sigue perfecto)", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "m158", "x": 1500.0, "y": 3432.5, "width": 0.0, "height": 30.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#868e96", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 543579, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 384513, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "points": [[0, 0], [0.0, 30.0]], "lastCommittedPoint": null, "startBinding": null, "endBinding": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": "arrow"}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "m159", "x": 1220, "y": 3462.5, "width": 560, "height": 145.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "#e7f5ff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 952379, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 175157, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"type": "text", "id": "m160", "x": 1234, "y": 3472.5, "width": 205.2, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 372975, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 809436, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Que pide cada verbo", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 18, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Que pide cada verbo", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "text", "id": "m161", "x": 1234, "y": 3502.5, "width": 459.0, "height": 93.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 233616, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 558464, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "'capacidad'  -> entrada equiprobable (simetrico) / \n  maximizar\n'info mutua'  -> usar los p(a) que dan\n'mejor / peor canal' -> leer cual\n'que simbolo enviar mas' -> el de menos ruido", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 15, "containerId": null, "originalText": "'capacidad'  -> entrada equiprobable (simetrico) / \n  maximizar\n'info mutua'  -> usar los p(a) que dan\n'mejor / peor canal' -> leer cual\n'que simbolo enviar mas' -> el de menos ruido", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "m162", "x": 1500.0, "y": 3608.25, "width": 0.0, "height": 30.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#868e96", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 567875, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 816899, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "points": [[0, 0], [0.0, 30.0]], "lastCommittedPoint": null, "startBinding": null, "endBinding": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": "arrow"}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "m163", "x": 1220, "y": 3638.25, "width": 560, "height": 183.25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "backgroundColor": "#fff5f5", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 527117, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 345679, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"type": "text", "id": "m164", "x": 1234, "y": 3648.25, "width": 345.59999999999997, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 667358, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 233877, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "TRAMPAS del canal (bajaron nota)", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 18, "containerId": null, "originalText": "TRAMPAS del canal (bajaron nota)", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "text", "id": "m165", "x": 1234, "y": 3678.25, "width": 513.0, "height": 131.25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 643017, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 850932, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "- Promediar UNA sola fila con 1/3 (hay TRES)\n- H(B) con los numeros de la matriz en vez de p(b_j)\n- I(A;B) negativa (-0,115) o > log2 q (8,7): hay error\n- Peor canal ternario con C != 0\n- Canal 'uniforme' con 1/3 en las otras filas\n- C > log2 q  o  C de un canal con 80% de aciertos ~ 1,28\n  -> señal de alarma: comparar con un BSC parecido", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 15, "containerId": null, "originalText": "- Promediar UNA sola fila con 1/3 (hay TRES)\n- H(B) con los numeros de la matriz en vez de p(b_j)\n- I(A;B) negativa (-0,115) o > log2 q (8,7): hay error\n- Peor canal ternario con C != 0\n- Canal 'uniforme' con 1/3 en las otras filas\n- C > log2 q  o  C de un canal con 80% de aciertos ~ 1,28\n  -> señal de alarma: comparar con un BSC parecido", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "m166", "x": 0, "y": 3885.5, "width": 1780, "height": 78, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e8590c", "backgroundColor": "#e8590c", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 826697, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 795159, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"type": "text", "id": "m167", "x": 20, "y": 3893.5, "width": 811.1999999999999, "height": 32.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#ffffff", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 894047, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 204626, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "5  DISCRETIZACION, CODIFICACION PREDICTIVA Y CIFRADO", "fontSize": 26, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 26, "containerId": null, "originalText": "5  DISCRETIZACION, CODIFICACION PREDICTIVA Y CIFRADO", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "text", "id": "m168", "x": 20, "y": 3931.5, "width": 711.0, "height": 18.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#ffffff", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 845235, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 251017, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Ejercicios que aparecieron fuera de los 3 bloques de la tabla del examen modelo", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 15, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Ejercicios que aparecieron fuera de los 3 bloques de la tabla del examen modelo", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "m169", "x": 0, "y": 3993.5, "width": 560, "height": 164.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "#e7f5ff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 858085, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 420149, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"type": "text", "id": "m170", "x": 14, "y": 4003.5, "width": 270.0, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 775814, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 842349, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Muestreo y cuantificacion", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 18, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Muestreo y cuantificacion", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "text", "id": "m171", "x": 14, "y": 4033.5, "width": 504.0, "height": 112.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 237754, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 209630, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Nyquist: f_s >= 2B  (si no: ALIASING)\nDelta = (Vmax - Vmin) / L ,  L = 2^n ,  e_q <= Delta/2\nTasa: R = f_s · n · c    (telefonia 8k·8·1 = 64 kbps)\nPCM: cuantifica cada muestra | DPCM: la DIFERENCIA entre\n  muestras (rango menor -> menos bits, mas robusto)\nADPCM: predictor adaptativo | Delta: DPCM de 1 bit", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 15, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Nyquist: f_s >= 2B  (si no: ALIASING)\nDelta = (Vmax - Vmin) / L ,  L = 2^n ,  e_q <= Delta/2\nTasa: R = f_s · n · c    (telefonia 8k·8·1 = 64 kbps)\nPCM: cuantifica cada muestra | DPCM: la DIFERENCIA entre\n  muestras (rango menor -> menos bits, mas robusto)\nADPCM: predictor adaptativo | Delta: DPCM de 1 bit", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "m172", "x": 280.0, "y": 4158.0, "width": 0.0, "height": 30.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#868e96", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 542784, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 516720, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "points": [[0, 0], [0.0, 30.0]], "lastCommittedPoint": null, "startBinding": null, "endBinding": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": "arrow"}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "m173", "x": 0, "y": 4188.0, "width": 560, "height": 164.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "backgroundColor": "#fff5f5", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 372835, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 766514, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"type": "text", "id": "m174", "x": 14, "y": 4198.0, "width": 486.0, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 30388, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 29295, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Discretizacion 'con valor medio del segmento'", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 18, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Discretizacion 'con valor medio del segmento'", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "text", "id": "m175", "x": 14, "y": 4228.0, "width": 531.0, "height": 112.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 828495, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 292992, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "ancho del segmento = 2 · error maximo\nniveles = rango / ancho        n = ceil(log2 niveles)\nPCM: rango de la señal | DPCM: rango de las DIFERENCIAS\nEj DPCM ±1V, e=0,005: 2/0,01 = 200 -> 8 bits\nEj PCM ±5V, e=0,005: 10/0,01 = 1000 -> 10 bits\nTRAMPA: dividir por el ERROR (400 niveles, 9 bits) esta mal", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 15, "containerId": null, "originalText": "ancho del segmento = 2 · error maximo\nniveles = rango / ancho        n = ceil(log2 niveles)\nPCM: rango de la señal | DPCM: rango de las DIFERENCIAS\nEj DPCM ±1V, e=0,005: 2/0,01 = 200 -> 8 bits\nEj PCM ±5V, e=0,005: 10/0,01 = 1000 -> 10 bits\nTRAMPA: dividir por el ERROR (400 niveles, 9 bits) esta mal", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "m176", "x": 280.0, "y": 4352.5, "width": 0.0, "height": 30.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#868e96", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 495180, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 271765, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "points": [[0, 0], [0.0, 30.0]], "lastCommittedPoint": null, "startBinding": null, "endBinding": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": "arrow"}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "m177", "x": 0, "y": 4382.5, "width": 560, "height": 145.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#f08c00", "backgroundColor": "#fff9db", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 203052, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 726162, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"type": "text", "id": "m178", "x": 14, "y": 4392.5, "width": 216.0, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#f08c00", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 634535, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 361005, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Compansion (teorica)", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 18, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Compansion (teorica)", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "text", "id": "m179", "x": 14, "y": 4422.5, "width": 531.0, "height": 93.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 468953, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 847843, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Compresion + expansion: curva no lineal (ley mu / A) antes\nde cuantificar y su inversa en el receptor. Cuantificacion\nno uniforme: mas resolucion en amplitudes chicas \n  (frecuentes)\nNecesidad: eficiencia de almacenamiento/transmision, costos", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 15, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Compresion + expansion: curva no lineal (ley mu / A) antes\nde cuantificar y su inversa en el receptor. Cuantificacion\nno uniforme: mas resolucion en amplitudes chicas \n  (frecuentes)\nNecesidad: eficiencia de almacenamiento/transmision, costos", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "m180", "x": 610, "y": 3993.5, "width": 560, "height": 183.25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "#ebfbee", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 982538, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 758255, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"type": "text", "id": "m181", "x": 624, "y": 4003.5, "width": 496.79999999999995, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 366498, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 382349, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Codificacion predictiva (compuerta OREX = XOR)", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 18, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Codificacion predictiva (compuerta OREX = XOR)", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "text", "id": "m182", "x": 624, "y": 4033.5, "width": 531.0, "height": 131.25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 84451, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 231172, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Predictor vs valor real:  1 = ERROR , 0 = ACIERTO\nBuen predictor -> muchos 0 y 1 aislados -> comprimir rachas\n1. Para cada 1: en K bits, cuantos ceros lo preceden\n2. Contenedor 2^K - 1 (todos 1) = 'la racha continua'\n3. Los ceros FINALES tambien llevan su racha\n4. Probar K = 2, 3, 4... bits totales = n° contenedores · K\n5. Elegir el minimo y VERIFICAR que K+1 empeora", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 15, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Predictor vs valor real:  1 = ERROR , 0 = ACIERTO\nBuen predictor -> muchos 0 y 1 aislados -> comprimir rachas\n1. Para cada 1: en K bits, cuantos ceros lo preceden\n2. Contenedor 2^K - 1 (todos 1) = 'la racha continua'\n3. Los ceros FINALES tambien llevan su racha\n4. Probar K = 2, 3, 4... bits totales = n° contenedores · K\n5. Elegir el minimo y VERIFICAR que K+1 empeora", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "m183", "x": 890.0, "y": 4176.75, "width": 0.0, "height": 30.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#868e96", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 107120, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 237866, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "points": [[0, 0], [0.0, 30.0]], "lastCommittedPoint": null, "startBinding": null, "endBinding": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": "arrow"}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "m184", "x": 610, "y": 4206.75, "width": 560, "height": 145.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e8590c", "backgroundColor": "#fff4e6", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 492915, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 206262, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"type": "text", "id": "m185", "x": 624, "y": 4216.75, "width": 324.0, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e8590c", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 354144, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 214302, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Verificar K optimo por formula", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 18, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Verificar K optimo por formula", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "text", "id": "m186", "x": 624, "y": 4246.75, "width": 504.0, "height": 93.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 506099, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 654382, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "p = prob. de ACIERTO (n° de 0 / total)\nL(K) = K / (1 - p^(2^K - 1))      el K que MINIMIZA L\nExponente 2^K - 1 (NO 2^(K-1)); p cuenta ceros (no unos)\nEj 30 bits (25 ceros, p=25/30): K=2:24 | K=3:18 | K=4:20\n   -> K optimo = 3", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 15, "containerId": null, "originalText": "p = prob. de ACIERTO (n° de 0 / total)\nL(K) = K / (1 - p^(2^K - 1))      el K que MINIMIZA L\nExponente 2^K - 1 (NO 2^(K-1)); p cuenta ceros (no unos)\nEj 30 bits (25 ceros, p=25/30): K=2:24 | K=3:18 | K=4:20\n   -> K optimo = 3", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "m187", "x": 1220, "y": 3993.5, "width": 560, "height": 220.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "#ebfbee", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 944042, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 639907, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"type": "text", "id": "m188", "x": 1234, "y": 4003.5, "width": 356.4, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 881261, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2002, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Cifrado: transposicion + Vigenere", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 18, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Cifrado: transposicion + Vigenere", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "text", "id": "m189", "x": 1234, "y": 4033.5, "width": 522.0, "height": 168.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 502765, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 953365, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Cifrar: transponer cada bloque con la clave de permutacion\n  y luego sumar la clave de Vigenere letra a letra\n  c = (m + k) mod 26     (A=0 ... Z=25)\nDescifrar en ORDEN INVERSO: m = (c - k) mod 26 y despues\n  deshacer la permutacion\nVigenere es mas seguro: varios alfabetos, aplana \n  frecuencias\n  (sube la entropia 3,605 -> 4,015). Transposicion las \n    conserva", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 15, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Cifrar: transponer cada bloque con la clave de permutacion\n  y luego sumar la clave de Vigenere letra a letra\n  c = (m + k) mod 26     (A=0 ... Z=25)\nDescifrar en ORDEN INVERSO: m = (c - k) mod 26 y despues\n  deshacer la permutacion\nVigenere es mas seguro: varios alfabetos, aplana \n  frecuencias\n  (sube la entropia 3,605 -> 4,015). Transposicion las \n    conserva", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "m190", "x": 1500.0, "y": 4214.25, "width": 0.0, "height": 30.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#868e96", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 684698, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 360718, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "points": [[0, 0], [0.0, 30.0]], "lastCommittedPoint": null, "startBinding": null, "endBinding": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": "arrow"}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "m191", "x": 1220, "y": 4244.25, "width": 560, "height": 108.25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#f08c00", "backgroundColor": "#fff9db", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 838488, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 674374, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"type": "text", "id": "m192", "x": 1234, "y": 4254.25, "width": 302.4, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#f08c00", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 88897, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 875193, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Comprimir y encriptar: ORDEN", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 18, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Comprimir y encriptar: ORDEN", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "text", "id": "m193", "x": 1234, "y": 4284.25, "width": 513.0, "height": 56.25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 692675, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 125729, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "PRIMERO comprimir, DESPUES encriptar.\nEl cifrado rompe frecuencias/patrones (sube H) y un texto\ncifrado ya casi no se comprime.", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 15, "containerId": null, "originalText": "PRIMERO comprimir, DESPUES encriptar.\nEl cifrado rompe frecuencias/patrones (sube H) y un texto\ncifrado ya casi no se comprime.", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "m194", "x": 1500.0, "y": 4352.5, "width": 0.0, "height": 30.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#868e96", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 953971, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 407410, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "points": [[0, 0], [0.0, 30.0]], "lastCommittedPoint": null, "startBinding": null, "endBinding": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": "arrow"}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "m195", "x": 1220, "y": 4382.5, "width": 560, "height": 89.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#495057", "backgroundColor": "#f1f3f5", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 820305, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 746055, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"type": "text", "id": "m196", "x": 1234, "y": 4392.5, "width": 291.59999999999997, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#495057", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 786580, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 209002, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Donde se encontro cada cosa", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 18, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Donde se encontro cada cosa", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "text", "id": "m197", "x": 1234, "y": 4422.5, "width": 522.0, "height": 37.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 501254, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 932196, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "PCM/DPCM + compansion: unidad 3 | predictiva: unidad 5\nCifrado: parcial 2022 | BWT inversa amnr$aaag -> anagrama$", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 15, "containerId": null, "originalText": "PCM/DPCM + compansion: unidad 3 | predictiva: unidad 5\nCifrado: parcial 2022 | BWT inversa amnr$aaag -> anagrama$", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "m198", "x": 0, "y": 4592.25, "width": 1780, "height": 78, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "backgroundColor": "#e03131", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 187194, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 455004, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"type": "text", "id": "m199", "x": 20, "y": 4600.25, "width": 889.1999999999999, "height": 32.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#ffffff", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 827469, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 666729, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "6  PREGUNTAS TEORICAS CERRADAS + ERRORES QUE BAJARON NOTA", "fontSize": 26, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 26, "containerId": null, "originalText": "6  PREGUNTAS TEORICAS CERRADAS + ERRORES QUE BAJARON NOTA", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "text", "id": "m200", "x": 20, "y": 4638.25, "width": 657.0, "height": 18.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#ffffff", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 348670, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 90964, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Todas se repiten en los parciales: tener la respuesta de 1-2 lineas lista", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 15, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Todas se repiten en los parciales: tener la respuesta de 1-2 lineas lista", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "m201", "x": 0, "y": 4700.25, "width": 560, "height": 258.25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "#e7f5ff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 839725, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 992127, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"type": "text", "id": "m202", "x": 14, "y": 4710.25, "width": 356.4, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 756889, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 415067, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Teoricas (1/2): respuestas cortas", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 18, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Teoricas (1/2): respuestas cortas", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "text", "id": "m203", "x": 14, "y": 4740.25, "width": 531.0, "height": 206.25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 485660, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 420885, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "LZW vs Huffman: primero LZW, despues Huffman.\nHuffman = Shannon = Fano: p_i = 2^(-l_i), suman 1, Kraft=1,\n   H=L.\nCompansion: ver franja 5.\nInstantaneo vs univoco: instantaneo ⊂ univoco; Huffman \n  siempre\n  da instantaneo.\nHuffman estatico y dinamico NO coinciden siempre (FALSO):\n  ej A,C,S: estatico A=1,C=00,S=01 | dinamico A=0,S=10,C=11\nMetodos estaticos: doble lectura, sin perdida.\nMayor redundancia -> mas se puede comprimir.", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 15, "containerId": null, "originalText": "LZW vs Huffman: primero LZW, despues Huffman.\nHuffman = Shannon = Fano: p_i = 2^(-l_i), suman 1, Kraft=1,\n   H=L.\nCompansion: ver franja 5.\nInstantaneo vs univoco: instantaneo ⊂ univoco; Huffman \n  siempre\n  da instantaneo.\nHuffman estatico y dinamico NO coinciden siempre (FALSO):\n  ej A,C,S: estatico A=1,C=00,S=01 | dinamico A=0,S=10,C=11\nMetodos estaticos: doble lectura, sin perdida.\nMayor redundancia -> mas se puede comprimir.", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "m204", "x": 610, "y": 4700.25, "width": 560, "height": 258.25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "#e7f5ff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 779462, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 992789, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"type": "text", "id": "m205", "x": 624, "y": 4710.25, "width": 356.4, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 89045, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 760007, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Teoricas (2/2): respuestas cortas", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 18, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Teoricas (2/2): respuestas cortas", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "text", "id": "m206", "x": 624, "y": 4740.25, "width": 513.0, "height": 206.25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 166573, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 178262, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Archivo comprimido: MAS entropia, MENOS redundancia\n  (se saco lo predecible).\nPCM vs DPCM: valor absoluto vs diferencia entre muestras.\nPeor canal: todo 1/q, C=0, independientes.\nMejor canal: identidad, C = log2 q.\nPeor BSC: p=0,5.\nBWT antes de Markov: mejor (agrupa iguales; justificar).\nComprimir antes que encriptar.\nVigenere mas seguro que transposicion.\nCuando se pasa a Huffman dinamico: no se conocen las\n  frecuencias de antemano (1 lectura).", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 15, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Archivo comprimido: MAS entropia, MENOS redundancia\n  (se saco lo predecible).\nPCM vs DPCM: valor absoluto vs diferencia entre muestras.\nPeor canal: todo 1/q, C=0, independientes.\nMejor canal: identidad, C = log2 q.\nPeor BSC: p=0,5.\nBWT antes de Markov: mejor (agrupa iguales; justificar).\nComprimir antes que encriptar.\nVigenere mas seguro que transposicion.\nCuando se pasa a Huffman dinamico: no se conocen las\n  frecuencias de antemano (1 lectura).", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "m207", "x": 1220, "y": 4700.25, "width": 560, "height": 258.25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "backgroundColor": "#fff5f5", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 133210, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 28888, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"type": "text", "id": "m208", "x": 1234, "y": 4710.25, "width": 302.4, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 158493, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 619512, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Errores que marco el docente", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 18, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Errores que marco el docente", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "text", "id": "m209", "x": 1234, "y": 4740.25, "width": 513.0, "height": 206.25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 948807, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 487959, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "1. Shannon: l entero exacto, NO sumar 1\n2. Discretizacion: ancho = 2·error\n3. Predictiva: verificar K+1 empeora\n4. Aritmetica: low = high -> NO se puede seguir\n5. Markov: dividir por el ORIGEN, ponderar por pi\n6. Fano != Huffman (leer que piden)\n7. Contestar TODOS los incisos y justificar ('¿por que?')\n8. Huffman dinamico: no olvidar el balanceo (Sibling)\n9. Peor vs mejor canal: leer cual piden\n10. Huffman por bigramas: unir de a 2, verificar Kraft=1\n11. Ergodicidad: usar accesibilidad, no 'tiene ceros'", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 15, "containerId": null, "originalText": "1. Shannon: l entero exacto, NO sumar 1\n2. Discretizacion: ancho = 2·error\n3. Predictiva: verificar K+1 empeora\n4. Aritmetica: low = high -> NO se puede seguir\n5. Markov: dividir por el ORIGEN, ponderar por pi\n6. Fano != Huffman (leer que piden)\n7. Contestar TODOS los incisos y justificar ('¿por que?')\n8. Huffman dinamico: no olvidar el balanceo (Sibling)\n9. Peor vs mejor canal: leer cual piden\n10. Huffman por bigramas: unir de a 2, verificar Kraft=1\n11. Ergodicidad: usar accesibilidad, no 'tiene ceros'", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "m210", "x": 0, "y": 5022.5, "width": 1780, "height": 78, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#495057", "backgroundColor": "#495057", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 845679, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 687718, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"type": "text", "id": "m211", "x": 20, "y": 5030.5, "width": 733.1999999999999, "height": 32.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#ffffff", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 153275, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 641282, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "7  CHECKLIST DE ULTIMO MINUTO ANTES DE ENTREGAR", "fontSize": 26, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 26, "containerId": null, "originalText": "7  CHECKLIST DE ULTIMO MINUTO ANTES DE ENTREGAR", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "text", "id": "m212", "x": 20, "y": 5068.5, "width": 405.0, "height": 18.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#ffffff", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 866660, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 624816, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Si algo de esto falla, hay un error de cuenta", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 15, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Si algo de esto falla, hay un error de cuenta", "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"type": "rectangle", "id": "m213", "x": 0, "y": 5130.5, "width": 1780, "height": 150, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#495057", "backgroundColor": "#f8f9fa", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 497400, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 689196, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"type": "text", "id": "m214", "x": 14, "y": 5142.5, "width": 1008.0, "height": 120.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 983006, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 367429, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "[ ] H <= L < H+1 (indep.)  |  H(S_M) <= L_M (Markov)  |  nunca compares L_M con H(S)\n[ ] Kraft: Σ 2^(-l_i) = 1 en Huffman  |  ningun codigo es prefijo de otro\n[ ] Cada fila de la matriz (Markov o canal) suma 1  |  p(B) suma 1  |  pi suma 1\n[ ] 0 <= I(A;B) <= min(H(A),H(B)) <= log2 q  |  C(BSC) = 1 - H(p)  |  peor canal C = 0\n[ ] Rotule cada resultado (bits totales Y bits/simbolo) y compare contra codigo fijo y contra la cota n·H\n[ ] Respondi TODAS las preguntas de cada inciso y justifique las teoricas", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 16, "containerId": null, "originalText": "[ ] H <= L < H+1 (indep.)  |  H(S_M) <= L_M (Markov)  |  nunca compares L_M con H(S)\n[ ] Kraft: Σ 2^(-l_i) = 1 en Huffman  |  ningun codigo es prefijo de otro\n[ ] Cada fila de la matriz (Markov o canal) suma 1  |  p(B) suma 1  |  pi suma 1\n[ ] 0 <= I(A;B) <= min(H(A),H(B)) <= log2 q  |  C(BSC) = 1 - H(p)  |  peor canal C = 0\n[ ] Rotule cada resultado (bits totales Y bits/simbolo) y compare contra codigo fijo y contra la cota n·H\n[ ] Respondi TODAS las preguntas de cada inciso y justifique las teoricas", "lineHeight": 1.25}], "appState": {"viewBackgroundColor": "#ffffff"}, "files": {}}